OL,3,A'I'm still paying a mortgage for a home
OL,4,Adestroyed by a fire'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSarah Williams vividly remembers
OL,7,Fwatching her home burn down on the
OL,8,Fnews. On 26 August 2024, she was on
OL,9,Fholiday when a neighbour texted her to
OL,10,Fsay the Spectrum Building in east
OL,11,FLondon was on fire.
OL,13,FBut two years on from the blaze in
OL,14,FDagenham, which left more than 80
OL,15,Fpeople homeless, residents including
OL,16,FWilliams say they are still "in limbo".
OL,18,FThe leaseholder said: "We're still just
OL,19,Fstuck waiting for other people to make
OL,20,Fdecisions about our future."
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
